# Responsive Design & Mobile-First Development

**CRITICAL**: All UI components MUST be responsive and provide excellent user experience on mobile devices, tablets, and desktops.

## Core Principles

### 1. Mobile-First Approach

**ALWAYS** design for mobile devices first, then enhance for larger screens:

```tsx
// ✅ Good - Mobile first with progressive enhancement
<div className="flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-4">
  <div className="w-full md:w-1/2">Content</div>
</div>

// ❌ Bad - Desktop first with mobile afterthought
<div className="flex flex-row gap-4">
  <div className="w-1/2">Content</div>
</div>
```

### 2. Tailwind Responsive Breakpoints

Use Tailwind's mobile-first breakpoint system:

- **Default (no prefix)**: Mobile (< 640px)
- **`sm:`**: Small tablets (≥ 640px)
- **`md:`**: Tablets (≥ 768px)
- **`lg:`**: Desktops (≥ 1024px)
- **`xl:`**: Large desktops (≥ 1280px)
- **`2xl:`**: Extra large screens (≥ 1536px)

```tsx
// Example: Button that's full width on mobile, auto width on desktop
<button className="w-full sm:w-auto px-4 py-2">
  Click me
</button>
```

## Mandatory Responsive Patterns

### Layout & Grid

#### Cards and Lists

```tsx
// ✅ Good - Responsive card layout
<div className="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
  {items.map(item => <Card key={item.id} {...item} />)}
</div>

// ❌ Bad - Fixed desktop grid
<div className="grid grid-cols-3 gap-6">
  {items.map(item => <Card key={item.id} {...item} />)}
</div>
```

#### Flex Layouts

```tsx
// ✅ Good - Stack on mobile, row on desktop
<div className="flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-4">
  <aside className="w-full md:w-64">Sidebar</aside>
  <main className="flex-1">Main content</main>
</div>

// ❌ Bad - Always horizontal, breaks on mobile
<div className="flex flex-row gap-6">
  <aside className="w-64">Sidebar</aside>
  <main className="flex-1">Main content</main>
</div>
```

### Typography

```tsx
// ✅ Good - Responsive text sizes
<h1 className="text-2xl sm:text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-bold">
  Page Title
</h1>
<p className="text-sm sm:text-base">
  Description text
</p>

// ❌ Bad - Fixed large text on mobile
<h1 className="text-4xl font-bold">
  Page Title
</h1>
```

### Spacing & Padding

```tsx
// ✅ Good - Responsive spacing
<div className="p-4 sm:p-6 lg:p-8">
  <div className="space-y-4 sm:space-y-6">
    Content with responsive gaps
  </div>
</div>

// ❌ Bad - Fixed large padding on mobile
<div className="p-8">
  <div className="space-y-6">
    Content
  </div>
</div>
```

### Images

```tsx
// ✅ Good - Responsive image sizing
<img 
  src={imageUrl} 
  alt="Description"
  className="w-full h-auto max-w-sm md:max-w-md lg:max-w-lg"
/>

// ❌ Bad - Fixed size, may overflow
<img 
  src={imageUrl} 
  alt="Description"
  className="w-96 h-64"
/>
```

## Component-Specific Requirements

### Navigation

```tsx
// ✅ Good - Mobile hamburger menu, desktop inline
<nav className="relative">
  {/* Mobile menu button */}
  <button className="md:hidden" onClick={toggleMenu}>
    <MenuIcon />
  </button>
  
  {/* Desktop navigation */}
  <div className="hidden md:flex md:gap-4">
    <NavLink href="/home">Home</NavLink>
    <NavLink href="/about">About</NavLink>
  </div>
  
  {/* Mobile menu */}
  {isMenuOpen && (
    <div className="md:hidden absolute top-full left-0 right-0 bg-white">
      <NavLink href="/home">Home</NavLink>
      <NavLink href="/about">About</NavLink>
    </div>
  )}
</nav>
```

### Tables

```tsx
// ✅ Good - Responsive table with scroll
<div className="overflow-x-auto">
  <table className="min-w-full">
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th className="px-4 py-2 text-left">Name</th>
        <th className="hidden sm:table-cell px-4 py-2">Email</th>
        <th className="hidden md:table-cell px-4 py-2">Phone</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
  </table>
</div>

// Alternative: Card view on mobile
<div className="block md:hidden space-y-4">
  {items.map(item => (
    <div key={item.id} className="bg-white p-4 rounded shadow">
      <p className="font-bold">{item.name}</p>
      <p className="text-sm text-gray-600">{item.email}</p>
    </div>
  ))}
</div>
<table className="hidden md:table">
  {/* Desktop table */}
</table>
```

### Buttons & Actions

```tsx
// ✅ Good - Full width on mobile, auto on desktop
<div className="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-2">
  <button className="w-full sm:w-auto px-4 py-2 bg-blue-600 text-white rounded">
    Primary Action
  </button>
  <button className="w-full sm:w-auto px-4 py-2 border rounded">
    Secondary Action
  </button>
</div>

// ✅ Good - Icon only on mobile, text on desktop
<button className="flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-2">
  <SaveIcon className="w-5 h-5" />
  <span className="hidden sm:inline">Save Changes</span>
</button>
```

### Forms

```tsx
